WEBVTT

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:04.636
Which half of the 3D scaffolding gets eaten.

00:00:04.636 --> 00:00:07.950
A Blender harness, its authors' warning, one measured number.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.610
The revisit, from the authors, in a post: All of today's scaffolding

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.149
will eventually get eaten by the base model.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:22.696
PSNR the staging adds on NeRF synthetic, measured at one backbone: +1.25 dB.

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.513
Three buckets, not two.

00:00:25.513 --> 00:00:27.654
Substitutes for a capability: eaten.

00:00:27.654 --> 00:00:29.794
Supply, like the render: shrinks.

00:00:29.794 --> 00:00:31.507
Constraints: repriced, not eaten.

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.207
The warning is mostly right.

00:00:34.207 --> 00:00:36.858
Constraints do not get eaten; they get repriced.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:44.108
Every number here is from the full article, with its sources, at ai.thesatyajit.com.
